cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this model or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "alakazam: aluminium injection into the mesosphere from satellite reentry"
abstract: >-
  Reentry and ablation model that estimates how much aluminium a satellite
  vaporizes during atmospheric entry and at which altitudes it is injected,
  with boiling at the local stagnation pressure, temperature-dependent
  emissivity of oxidized and bare aluminium, and automated checks that keep
  the reported numbers in sync with the code.
authors:
